msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Voorbeeld::"

#: ../../library/microdot.cors.rst:125
msgid ""
"The preflight ``OPTIONS`` request is handled automatically; the camera "
"returns the appropriate ``Access-Control-*`` headers and ``204 No Content``."
" Actual ``GET`` / ``POST`` / etc. responses pick up the ``Access-Control-"
"Allow-Origin`` header via the registered after-request hook."
msgstr ""
"Het preflight-\\ ``OPTIONS``\\ -verzoek wordt automatisch afgehandeld; de "
"camera retourneert de juiste ``Access-Control-*``\\ -headers en ``204 No "
"Content``\\ . De daadwerkelijke ``GET`` / ``POST`` / enz. antwoorden krijgen"
" de ``Access-Control-Allow-Origin``\\ -header via de geregistreerde after-"
"request-hook."
